---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE, TOPICS } from "../site";
import { slugify } from "../utils";
---
<Base title="About" description={`A little about ${SITE.author} and this blog.`}>
  <article>
    <header class="post-header">
      <h1>Hi, welcome to my blog</h1>
      <p class="lead">Why I started writing, and what you can read here.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I am <strong>{SITE.author}</strong>.</p>
      <p>
        For a long time I mostly made videos. But some things are not meant for the camera: a thought
        on an evening walk, a half-read book, an ordinary day I want to remember a little longer.
      </p>
      <p>This blog is the place for those things.</p>

      <h2>What you will find here</h2>
      <ul>
        {TOPICS.map((t) => (
          <li><a href={`/tag/${slugify(t.name)}/`}>{t.name}</a>: {t.description}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p>I do not promise to write on a schedule. But every post here is something I truly think.</p>
      <p>
        Besides writing, I make videos on my <a href={SITE.youtube} target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube channel</a>.
        To get new posts, you can follow along via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
      </p>
      <p>Thanks for stopping by.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
